<title>JAPAN: Unisia Jecs - 6-mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Unisia Jecs - 6-mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			LATEST 6-MTH     ACTUAL 7-MTH</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   RESULTS</p>
<p> Sales		105.00	     122.82</p>
<p> Current		1.70		 2.20</p>
<p> Net		  800    million	 937    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.22 yen	   6.12 yen</p>
<p> Ord div		3.75 yen	   4.40 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Unisia Jecs Corp is a car parts maker affiliated</p>
<p>with Nissan Motor Co Ltd. The forecasts are for the</p>
<p>six-month period ending on March 31, 1997, because the</p>
<p>company changed its business term.</p>
</text>
